    "body": "I got this, personally (in the very folder where it was slow)\n\n```\n❯ time stack --no-install-ghc --lock-file read-only ghc -- --numeric-version\n8.6.5\n\n________________________________________________________\nExecuted in  439,62 millis    fish           external  \n   usr time  372,84 millis  556,00 micros  372,28 millis  \n   sys time   58,25 millis   89,00 micros   58,16 millis  \n```\n\nOn May 21 2020, at 8:39 pm, Hirochika Matsumoto\n<notifications@github.com> wrote:\n\n> The cause appears to be the command used to obtain the version of\n> Haskell is slow.\n>  \n> The command is stack --no-install-ghc --lock-file read-only ghc --\n> --numeric-version(cf. here), and it takes around 250ms when I run it locally.\n>  \n> —\n> You are receiving this because you authored the thread.\n> Reply to this email directly, view it on GitHub, or unsubscribe.\n>  \n> [ { \"@context\": \"http://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"EmailMessage\",\n> \"potentialAction\": { \"@type\": \"ViewAction\", \"target\":\n> \"https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/1240#issuecomment-632274418\",\n> \"url\":\n> \"https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/1240#issuecomment-632274418\",\n> \"name\": \"View Issue\" }, \"description\": \"View this Issue on GitHub\",\n> \"publisher\": { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"GitHub\", \"url\":\n> \"https://github.com\" } } ]\n",
